  "text.autoconfig.littlemaidrebirth.option.spawn.defaultSoundPackName.@Tooltip": "Wild maids spawn with the specified sound pack.\nThis does not affect already spawned wild maids.\nSpecification must match exactly, and available sound packs can be checked from the sound pack list.\nIf no match is found, the specification is ignored.",

